  "id": "the-subjective-truth",
  "title": "The Subjective Truth",
  "subtitle": "",
  "description": "Last year Buddha Kline vanished from the Carson National Forest while searching for the Forrest Fenn Treasure. What starts as an investigation into a hikers disappearance, quickly transforms into an observation on the subjective nature of reality, branching out with elements of futurology, comedy, horror and high strangeness. Join our host Graham Anderson as she unearths all the answers to the question of... What happened to Buddha Kline?&nbsp;From alien abductions to haunted hotels to reincarnation robots, everyone has a theory. But no one knows the truth. The Subjective Truth is a paranormal docudrama. Created by Jeremy Ellett. A Good Pointe Original.",
